{"id":"n16745-2-6","stage":3,"title":"씻기다 · 被一洗而空","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16745-2-6-1","ko":"공부를 좀 하려고 하는데 너무 졸려.","zh":"我本来想学习一会儿的，但是太困了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸려.","meaning":"困","explanation":"졸리다：困；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"졸리다","audio":"/audio/2666ddee9bee00d2539f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24623","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"2666ddee9bee00d2","term":"졸리다","zh":"困","audio":"/audio/2666ddee9bee00d2539f.mp3","entryId":"24623","definition":"有想睡觉的感觉。","pronunciation":["졸ː리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2e589736be39cf3a5f30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16745-2-6-2","ko":"샤워를 해봐. 그럼 졸음이 다 씻길 거야.","zh":"去洗个澡吧，这样困意就会全消了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"샤워를","meaning":"淋浴","explanation":"샤워：淋浴；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"샤워","audio":"/audio/d817568d54265953a07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62296","senseId":"1","lemma":"샤워","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해봐.","meaning":"做，干；试，试图","explanation":"하다：做，干；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"졸음이","meaning":"困意，睡意","explanation":"졸음：困意，睡意；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"졸음","audio":"/audio/6cd67daad4601281ec43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24626","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"씻길","meaning":"被一洗而空","explanation":"씻기다：被一洗而空；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"씻기다","audio":"/audio/4a13bf63794b7fd15279.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16745","senseId":"2","lemma":"씻기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d817568d54265953","term":"샤워","zh":"淋浴","audio":"/audio/d817568d54265953a07d.mp3","entryId":"62296","definition":"用像下雨一样喷水的器具清洗身体。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"6cd67daad4601281","term":"졸음","zh":"困意，睡意","audio":"/audio/6cd67daad4601281ec43.mp3","entryId":"24626","definition":"想睡觉的感觉或状态。","pronunciation":["조ː름"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"4a13bf63794b7fd1","term":"씻기다","zh":"被一洗而空","audio":"/audio/4a13bf63794b7fd15279.mp3","entryId":"16745","definition":"原来不好的状态完全消失。","pronunciation":["씯끼다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/b8d648809a5ca05da9c7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"sour